flowchart LR
    Start([Audit route request]) --> Method{GET request?}
    Method -->|No| ReadOnly[Return 405 read-only]
    Method -->|Yes| Auth{Authenticated active ADMIN?}
    Auth -->|No| Denied[Return safe 401 or 403]
    Auth -->|Yes| Validate{Filters and cursor valid?}
    Validate -->|No| Invalid[Return field validation]
    Validate -->|Yes| DbAuth{Database confirms ADMIN?}
    DbAuth -->|No| Denied
    DbAuth -->|Yes| Query[Filter actor, action, category, UTC dates]
    Query --> Page[Order by created_at and id descending]
    Page --> Scrub[Project and scrub safe summaries]
    Scrub --> Result{Matching records?}
    Result -->|No| Empty[Render empty state]
    Result -->|Yes| Table[Render read-only table]
    Table --> More{More records?}
    More -->|Yes| Cursor[Use stable next cursor]
    More -->|No| Done([Review complete])
    Cursor --> Table
    Empty --> Done

    Append[Event, moderation, and account actions append records] -.-> Store[(event_action_records)]
    Store --> Query
    Immutable[Triggers and grants block update, delete, and truncate] -.-> Store

